      "otheronline": "",
      "description": "Boston-based singer-songwriter damian israel shiner blends folk roots with rock energy, delivering emotionally resonant songs and a compelling live show that has earned him a loyal following across New England. Known for a busy performance schedule and engaging stage presence, he has built his reputation through consistent, high-impact live performances.\r\n\r\nShiner’s reach extends beyond the region, with appearances at The Whisky a Go Go and The Viper Room in Los Angeles, The Fiddler’s Elbow in London, and the Fringe Club in Hong Kong, along with regional touring and radio airplay.\r\n\r\nA two-time songwriting award winner in 2025 and a 2026 honoree from the New England Songwriting Competition, Shiner continues to gain recognition for his craft. With roots in folk and a broad Americana and rock sensibility, damian israel shiner &amp; the displayers are a band on the rise, with new music and performances on the horizon.",
