    "1783911729.3775695": {
      "actname": "Our Neighbours Will Be Thrilled",
      "genre": "",
      "other_genre": "",
      "website": "",
      "facebook": "",
      "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/ourneighborswillbethrilled",
      "bandcamp": "",
      "spotify": "",
      "apple": "",
      "youtube": "",
      "soniccloud": "",
      "otheronline": "",
      "description": "As if one brand-spanking new library and one epic new rink was not enough, 2026 also saw Belmont invest handsomely in their home-grown protégés for another year, as Our Neighbours Will Be Thrilled ingratiate themselves with their generous townsfolk for another spectacle of extraordinary live music in their own front yard. \r\n\r\nIt’s mum-and-dad-jam-band just as you like it: thick with a hammy 90’s core, a drizzle of 80’s PERM-ROCK, heavy on the air guitar, enthusiastic with the three-part harmonies and drenched with foot-tapping rock nostalgia. \r\n\r\nWe’ll even throw in some modern pop anthems to show you WE’VE STILL GOT IT and appeal to the next-gen wannabe rockers. And just when you thought the face-melting Stratocaster had finally shown mercy on the non-believers? We’ll go and mash-it up again with another ill-advised boy band/punk pop lovechild and leave you hoarse, begging for the next song.\r\n\r\nThis is not a drill: ONWBT are back and it’s going to be tremendous.",
      "image": "6a544982a0bd0",
      "play_rain": "",
      "_id": "1783911729.3775695"
    },
