      "description": "Mike Bhaiya is an MC, activist, and poet based in Jamaica Plain, Boston. His psychedelic conscious hip hop spans upbeat party bangers to introspective soul searching confessionals and strident movement music. He unwaveringly indicts the global-local powerholders and systems with a clarion call for community based collective resistance and mutual care and aid.",
